# LIBRARY: own
# What Link claims that a container holds is checked where it is read. `get` returns what the map holds or, on a miss, undefined.
# Where Link claims that the map holds only undefined, or nothing, the type of the result is a single marker, a type that needs no register.
# So the operation held no value, no entry check of the contents followed it, and `=== undefined` was folded to true at compile time.
# Now such an operation keeps what the map returns, just like an operation whose type, derived from the contents, is an unboxed number.
# A map that truly holds only undefined: the entry check is there and lets the value pass.
